meta {
  name: Reinitialiser le PIN (PIN requis)
  type: http
  seq: 6
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/admin/api/users/{{created_user_id}}/reset-pin
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
  X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}
}

body {
  {
    "pin_email": "{{pin_email}}",
    "pin": "{{pin}}"
  }
}

docs {
Efface le PIN de la cible ; elle le redefinit ensuite en self-service (/admin/profile/pin).
}
